        "slc_aaf6ca3001ab5c153cb66b7a501db63dc082feec6f8c4c516a39fb3f40f9ca78"
      ],
      "text": "Autocomplete is context-aware: the editor analyzes its content (and neighboring documents) to predict suggestions, with multi-document context improving completion quality."
    },
